  "title": "Italian Grilled Shrimp Salad",
  "description": "Grilled shrimp are tossed in a zesty, Italian dressing-based mixture with veggies and served on crisp romaine lettuce in this easy and refreshing salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Bernice Dray"
  ],
